                <pb facs="0136" n="16" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg16"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador to Secretary Loeb.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lenox, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Following from governor-general Canada: Please personally convey my profoundest
                    and most reverent sympathy to the President on the great personal as well as
                    national loss he has sustained. The sad news has only just reached me on the
                    banks of the Cascapedia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Durand.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
